Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:57:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the New look switch: one on or off setting per business

A new, additive pair of calls (get_new_look, set_new_look). The setting is a key in Frappe's
existing DefaultValue table, so there is no new document type, field or migration, and no
existing record changes. A business is off until an owner (System Manager) turns it on.

